{"id":"3a19d5715745463a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-stable-sentence.md","title":"一致固定点间同值的稳定性","display":"df-stable-sentence — 一致固定点间同值的稳定性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-stable-sentence","aliases":["91-df-stable-sentence","91-df-stable"],"display":"df-stable-sentence — 一致固定点间同值的稳定性","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-stable-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-stable-sentence</span><span>91-df-stable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stable-sentence — 一致固定点间同值的稳定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J):\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J):\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\\)</span> 非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a> 的三值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\exists a\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\ \\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_X(\\varphi)=a],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\exists a\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\ \\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_X(\\varphi)=a],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本目录保留的局部术语，表达一致固定点间的同值性；不是原书修正语义的 eventual stability，也不应与 grounded、intrinsic 等术语互换。\n只比较一致固定点，不将含 glut 的最大代数固定点塞入三值表。标准说谎者在本意义下稳定为间隙；真理陈述者不稳定。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1，印刷页 196–197，PDF 页 207–208（本目录对该固定点分类的局部缩写）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v_X$ 为 [[91-df-truth-value-function]] 的三值函数；$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J):\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\exists a\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\ \\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_X(\\varphi)=a],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Stable}_J(\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1358,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9bbbe4420f54ce9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stable}_J$ 采用 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的全固定点同值约定。"},{"id":"6b350e567d372da0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)$、$v_X$、$\\mathrm{Stable}_J$ 采用 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的同一非空固定点类。"},{"id":"417cabd731eca511","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"601ad32e52e9aa55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"525f810b84880b72","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)$ (见 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的稳定性谓词)"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[